  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop on risk analysis for poultry health was conducted in Laos. The purpose of the workshop was to build local capacity on risk analysis for poultry health. A total of 60 participants attended the training course, 48 of whom were from nine provincial offices of the Livestock and Fisheries Department (Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry), the remaining participants were from the National Animal Health Center, Ministry of Health.</narrative>
  </description>
